WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:16.264
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:16.534 --> 00:22.869
(Firefly Theater)

3
00:43.456 --> 00:47.392
♪Neon lights twist into a knot♪

4
00:49.024 --> 00:52.608
♪I rest in the ruins of defeat♪

5
00:53.184 --> 00:55.520
♪You tap your fingers lightly♪

6
00:55.904 --> 00:58.656
♪I fall into the abyss♪

7
00:59.488 --> 01:02.080
♪I've seen this game before♪

8
01:02.080 --> 01:04.768
♪Every single move was calculated♪

9
01:04.768 --> 01:07.168
♪I finally see your silhouette♪

10
01:07.552 --> 01:10.304
♪Just an empty shell♪

11
01:10.624 --> 01:13.440
♪I've broken this game before♪

12
01:13.440 --> 01:15.872
♪Every move was placed wrong♪

13
01:15.872 --> 01:18.016
♪Now it's my turn to play♪

14
01:18.208 --> 01:25.056
♪I'll show you what stunning looks like♪

15
01:25.728 --> 01:28.256
♪When I stand back up again♪

16
01:28.544 --> 01:30.400
♪The whole city goes dark♪

17
01:31.264 --> 01:33.952
♪For the part you owe me♪

18
01:34.112 --> 01:41.088
♪I'll make you pay double♪

19
01:42.624 --> 01:47.360
♪You're just my starting point♪

20
01:51.712 --> 01:52.739
=The Vanishing Beauty=

21
01:53.000 --> 01:55.720
=Episode 23=

22
01:56.985 --> 02:00.097
(Bunny Blan's Botanical Garden)

23
02:00.884 --> 02:01.565
(Wait, is there)

24
02:01.565 --> 02:02.405
(a cup missing?)

25
02:02.685 --> 02:03.484
(How much was it?)

26
02:04.005 --> 02:04.884
(I'll pay you triple.)

27
02:07.964 --> 02:08.365
Hello.

28
02:09.125 --> 02:10.245
I'm looking for a tea set

29
02:10.245 --> 02:11.245
as a gift for a woman.

30
02:11.604 --> 02:12.204
Anything

31
02:12.204 --> 02:13.285
with a stronger design?

32
02:13.884 --> 02:14.764
Any recommendations?

33
02:15.085 --> 02:15.965
Sure, just a moment.

34
02:17.531 --> 02:20.468
(Di Liren)

35
02:23.456 --> 02:26.418
(Trust Company)

36
02:27.005 --> 02:27.644
Hello?

37
02:28.405 --> 02:29.245
Hello, Ms. Lu.

38
02:29.685 --> 02:30.444
Your trust account

39
02:30.444 --> 02:31.484
with us

40
02:31.644 --> 02:33.204
has had its beneficiary updated.

41
02:33.845 --> 02:35.245
It changed from Fang Haoyu

42
02:35.324 --> 02:36.204
to Yu Meng.

43
02:36.285 --> 02:36.805
Impossible.

44
02:36.845 --> 02:37.845
Did you get it wrong?

45
02:38.685 --> 02:39.405
I never changed

46
02:39.444 --> 02:40.085
the beneficiary.

47
02:41.164 --> 02:41.767
Please hold on.

48
02:42.604 --> 02:43.604
The system shows

49
02:43.724 --> 02:44.924
Fang Haoyu did it in person.

50
02:45.005 --> 02:46.604
Under the trust terms,

51
02:46.764 --> 02:47.565
the beneficiary

52
02:47.565 --> 02:48.245
can transfer it.

53
02:48.365 --> 02:49.005
That's insane.

54
02:50.724 --> 02:51.685
I set up the trust.

55
02:51.924 --> 02:53.365
It requires my signed authorization.

56
02:54.685 --> 02:55.365
You must revoke

57
02:55.525 --> 02:56.525
the transfer immediately.

58
02:57.125 --> 02:58.644
I'm sorry. We can't do that.

59
02:59.204 --> 03:00.444
Once the trust takes effect,

60
03:00.565 --> 03:02.405
disposition rights belong to the beneficiary.

61
03:17.324 --> 03:18.511
Where's the trust I gave you?

62
03:19.724 --> 03:20.444
I gave it to Meng

63
03:20.764 --> 03:21.546
as a birthday gift.

64
03:23.365 --> 03:24.186
Why give it to her?

65
03:25.085 --> 03:26.085
Did you even ask me?

66
03:26.644 --> 03:27.724
Did you ask for my opinion

67
03:27.764 --> 03:29.044
when you sent me abroad?

68
03:29.965 --> 03:30.444
That money

69
03:30.444 --> 03:31.164
was always Meng's.

70
03:31.204 --> 03:31.884
I didn't give it.

71
03:32.125 --> 03:32.725
I returned it.

72
03:33.565 --> 03:34.005
Did...

73
03:34.724 --> 03:36.017
Did someone feed you nonsense?

74
03:36.324 --> 03:36.965
Including what

75
03:36.965 --> 03:37.644
you and Dad said?

76
03:39.125 --> 03:39.724
I heard

77
03:40.324 --> 03:41.484
everything at the restaurant.

78
03:41.884 --> 03:42.805
Dad took all that money

79
03:42.884 --> 03:43.884
from the Yu family.

80
03:44.845 --> 03:45.164
Mom,

81
03:46.285 --> 03:47.044
you knew that money

82
03:47.044 --> 03:47.644
was dirty.

83
03:48.085 --> 03:49.125
Why did you still keep it?

84
03:51.484 --> 03:52.484
To secure your future.

85
03:53.565 --> 03:54.405
With that money,

86
03:55.525 --> 03:57.164
you wouldn't worry about surgery costs,

87
03:58.204 --> 03:59.484
and you'd be set for life.

88
04:01.044 --> 04:01.685
I couldn't bear

89
04:01.764 --> 04:03.005
to watch my child suffer again,

90
04:03.285 --> 04:04.232
too poor for treatment.

91
04:04.484 --> 04:05.365
But I can work.

92
04:05.484 --> 04:06.565
I can support myself.

93
04:06.644 --> 04:07.044
I solve

94
04:07.085 --> 04:07.924
my own problems.

95
04:08.005 --> 04:08.845
I'm not helpless.

96
04:10.085 --> 04:10.685
Even if...

97
04:11.285 --> 04:12.245
Even if I drop school

98
04:12.444 --> 04:13.204
or have to starve,

99
04:13.324 --> 04:14.005
I will pay back

100
04:14.044 --> 04:14.644
the money.

101
04:15.565 --> 04:17.125
You're so naive.

102
04:18.284 --> 04:19.365
Money's not easy to make.

103
04:19.565 --> 04:20.324
Without a degree,

104
04:20.444 --> 04:21.460
what job could you get?

105
04:21.605 --> 04:22.485
How will you repay it?

106
04:22.485 --> 04:23.125
With what?

107
04:25.884 --> 04:26.565
Listen to me,

108
04:27.925 --> 04:29.844
let's go to the trust company right now,

109
04:30.764 --> 04:31.964
revoke the transfer,

110
04:32.324 --> 04:33.365
and get the money back,

111
04:33.365 --> 04:33.884
okay?

112
04:34.524 --> 04:35.485
Dad said the same thing.

113
04:37.284 --> 04:38.125
But his reaction

114
04:39.964 --> 04:40.565
was far worse.

115
04:41.204 --> 04:42.045
You told your dad

116
04:43.324 --> 04:44.444
you gave the trust away?

117
04:45.444 --> 04:46.725
He'd find out sooner or later.

118
04:47.764 --> 04:48.964
I wanted him to know

119
04:49.005 --> 04:49.524
my resolve.

120
04:57.444 --> 04:57.925
Mom,

121
05:00.644 --> 05:01.245
I know

122
05:01.605 --> 05:02.524
how much you and Dad

123
05:02.605 --> 05:03.725
have sacrificed for me.

124
05:04.524 --> 05:05.125
And I know

125
05:05.844 --> 05:06.485
without you two,

126
05:07.284 --> 05:08.005
I wouldn't have

127
05:08.005 --> 05:08.764
such a good life.

128
05:09.245 --> 05:10.245
But I can't just stand by

129
05:10.245 --> 05:11.045
and let you do wrong

130
05:11.125 --> 05:12.005
just for my sake.

131
05:13.125 --> 05:13.725
All I want

132
05:14.284 --> 05:15.805
is for you, Dad,

133
05:16.045 --> 05:16.925
and me

134
05:17.245 --> 05:17.685
to live

135
05:17.764 --> 05:19.125
safe and sound together.

136
05:20.005 --> 05:20.764
Let's just

137
05:21.045 --> 05:21.805
drop the trust.

138
05:21.844 --> 05:22.764
Just let it go.

139
05:24.204 --> 05:24.685
Okay?

140
05:25.204 --> 05:26.579
You've never faced the real world.

141
05:29.404 --> 05:30.605
You don't know what the money

142
05:32.084 --> 05:33.125
means for you.

143
05:33.964 --> 05:34.964
When you're older,

144
05:35.884 --> 05:37.084
you'll understand.

145
05:38.045 --> 05:39.045
When you were little

146
05:39.125 --> 05:39.844
and wouldn't eat,

147
05:42.045 --> 05:43.005
I had to chase after you

148
05:43.125 --> 05:44.764
to feed you bite by bite.

149
05:46.324 --> 05:47.165
I know what's

150
05:47.165 --> 05:47.884
best for you.

151
05:49.245 --> 05:50.644
I can't let this money go.

152
05:52.245 --> 05:52.605
Mom.

153
05:53.485 --> 05:53.884
Mom!

154
06:02.964 --> 06:03.884
You liar!

155
06:04.964 --> 06:05.524
You promised

156
06:05.605 --> 06:06.524
to cut ties with Haoyu.

157
06:06.964 --> 06:07.925
You broke your word

158
06:08.644 --> 06:09.204
and even went

159
06:09.245 --> 06:10.204
after his trust fund.

160
06:10.764 --> 06:11.365
You tricked him

161
06:11.404 --> 06:12.332
into giving it to you,

162
06:12.644 --> 06:13.084
didn't you?

163
06:14.964 --> 06:15.752
You misunderstood.

164
06:16.404 --> 06:17.284
The trust caught me

165
06:18.245 --> 06:18.964
by surprise too.

166
06:19.245 --> 06:20.685
Then give it back to Haoyu.

167
06:22.725 --> 06:23.404
Impossible.

168
06:24.084 --> 06:24.925
That money was ours

169
06:24.964 --> 06:25.617
to begin with.

170
06:25.805 --> 06:27.241
Di Liren earned every cent of it.

171
06:27.884 --> 06:29.125
He worked his heart out

172
06:29.485 --> 06:30.404
to build up Jiali.

173
06:30.764 --> 06:31.884
That's what he deserved.

174
06:33.245 --> 06:34.245
He was willing

175
06:34.404 --> 06:35.485
to stay and work at Jiali

176
06:36.204 --> 06:37.284
only to secure a safety net

177
06:37.524 --> 06:38.805
and a future for Haoyu.

178
06:39.045 --> 06:39.644
That money

179
06:40.005 --> 06:41.045
should go to Haoyu.

180
06:41.524 --> 06:43.165
Without the platform my family provided

181
06:43.524 --> 06:44.565
and all those connections,

182
06:44.805 --> 06:45.644
could he make it?

183
06:46.005 --> 06:46.884
He couldn't even get

184
06:46.925 --> 06:47.590
into the circle.

185
06:48.284 --> 06:48.925
I understand

186
06:48.964 --> 06:50.084
your feelings as a mother.

187
06:51.284 --> 06:52.725
But let me ask you,

188
06:53.524 --> 06:54.644
do you really know Harry?

189
06:55.284 --> 06:55.764
He's

190
06:55.764 --> 06:57.084
an independent, grown adult.

191
06:57.245 --> 06:58.565
He's capable and talented.

192
06:58.764 --> 06:59.524
He can already

193
06:59.524 --> 07:01.045
make a living with his own hands.

194
07:02.005 --> 07:02.844
Look around here.

195
07:03.764 --> 07:04.805
Every single detail here

196
07:05.844 --> 07:06.365
was designed

197
07:06.365 --> 07:07.324
by Harry personally.

198
07:11.685 --> 07:13.125
Look at these simple-looking lights.

199
07:14.005 --> 07:15.045
He calculated

200
07:15.485 --> 07:16.485
each one's angle

201
07:16.925 --> 07:17.764
so the light

202
07:17.884 --> 07:19.245
would shine without glaring

203
07:19.444 --> 07:20.805
into the customers' eyes.

204
07:22.245 --> 07:23.165
And these chairs.

205
07:24.005 --> 07:24.725
He visited

206
07:24.844 --> 07:26.045
every furniture market,

207
07:26.204 --> 07:27.404
testing out each chair himself

208
07:27.524 --> 07:28.352
before picking them.

209
07:28.725 --> 07:30.125
He said a backrest with this curve

210
07:30.404 --> 07:31.324
is ergonomic,

211
07:31.725 --> 07:32.925
so customers won't get tired.

212
07:33.805 --> 07:34.764
He went through

213
07:34.805 --> 07:35.964
eight whole drafts

214
07:36.045 --> 07:37.565
for the color palette of

215
07:37.644 --> 07:38.045
the space,

216
07:38.204 --> 07:38.925
walls, carpets,

217
07:38.964 --> 07:39.644
and furniture.

218
07:39.844 --> 07:40.964
He even mixed the wall paint

219
07:41.084 --> 07:41.925
a dozen times to get

220
07:42.005 --> 07:42.764
the shade right.

221
07:43.485 --> 07:44.284
Every customer

222
07:44.485 --> 07:45.644
who walks in praises it.

223
07:46.925 --> 07:47.844
For a place this big,

224
07:48.884 --> 07:49.764
with so many floors,

225
07:51.565 --> 07:52.844
he must have worn himself out.

226
07:54.084 --> 07:54.844
All this is just

227
07:55.524 --> 07:56.404
to let you know

228
07:57.125 --> 07:58.284
he truly loves this work.

229
07:58.485 --> 07:59.764
And he has the eye, the taste,

230
07:59.764 --> 08:00.404
and the talent.

231
08:00.844 --> 08:01.524
But you?

232
08:01.805 --> 08:02.805
You don't support him

233
08:02.884 --> 08:03.524
or see him.

234
08:03.644 --> 08:04.644
You keep sheltering him

235
08:04.725 --> 08:05.764
in a glass dome,

236
08:05.884 --> 08:06.524
planning a life

237
08:06.565 --> 08:07.685
he doesn't want.

238
08:08.045 --> 08:09.605
Is that really good for him?

239
08:10.045 --> 08:11.204
Will he truly be happy?

240
08:13.964 --> 08:14.884
I believe one day,

241
08:16.444 --> 08:17.365
when he's older,

242
08:18.204 --> 08:18.805
he'll get it

243
08:19.565 --> 08:20.524
and come around.

244
08:23.324 --> 08:24.764
You're the one who needs to get it.

245
08:32.684 --> 08:33.164
Alright,

246
08:34.125 --> 08:35.205
considering Harry

247
08:36.044 --> 08:37.284
returned the money on his own

248
08:37.804 --> 08:38.965
and saved me a lot of hassle,

249
08:39.764 --> 08:40.644
I can give him a share

250
08:40.725 --> 08:41.605
of the benefits.

251
08:41.965 --> 08:43.884
It'll ensure he finishes his studies

252
08:44.044 --> 08:44.965
and fulfill

253
08:45.245 --> 08:46.524
your wish as a mother.

254
08:46.804 --> 08:47.564
Everyone wins.

255
08:48.044 --> 08:48.445
Okay?

256
08:51.245 --> 08:52.205
Only one option?

257
08:52.884 --> 08:53.485
What else?

258
08:54.044 --> 08:55.485
You have to give Haoyu

259
08:55.564 --> 08:56.644
half the benefits.

260
08:57.445 --> 08:57.884
Remember,

261
08:59.005 --> 08:59.924
I still have Weng Xin's

262
09:00.044 --> 09:01.044
wellness center records

263
09:01.044 --> 09:01.804
that you want.

264
09:02.884 --> 09:03.445
Ms. Hui,

265
09:03.965 --> 09:04.644
I'm done haggling

266
09:04.644 --> 09:05.485
with you.

267
09:06.125 --> 09:07.125
Ten percent

268
09:07.164 --> 09:07.884
is my final offer.

269
09:08.644 --> 09:09.644
If you don't agree,

270
09:10.644 --> 09:11.564
you'll face two issues.

271
09:12.284 --> 09:12.804
First,

272
09:13.485 --> 09:14.564
knowing Harry,

273
09:14.845 --> 09:15.365
he will never

274
09:15.445 --> 09:16.325
touch this money.

275
09:18.764 --> 09:19.125
Second,

276
09:19.644 --> 09:20.684
I'll go after Di Liren

277
09:20.725 --> 09:21.924
for moving the assets,

278
09:22.485 --> 09:23.605
and Harry will inevitably

279
09:24.005 --> 09:24.884
face a lawsuit.

280
09:25.845 --> 09:26.725
That's certainly not

281
09:27.164 --> 09:27.884
the outcome

282
09:27.884 --> 09:28.804
you want to see.

283
09:31.644 --> 09:32.284
Think it over

284
09:32.965 --> 09:33.564
and answer me.

285
09:39.524 --> 09:40.284
Why is Mr. Di here?

286
09:40.404 --> 09:41.325
Did he get the notice?

287
09:41.365 --> 09:41.884
No way.

288
09:52.510 --> 09:55.643
(Chairman's Office)

289
09:58.965 --> 10:00.965
This leather chair is really comfortable.

290
10:01.644 --> 10:03.245
And I just found out

291
10:03.485 --> 10:05.764
it reclines automatically.

292
10:06.564 --> 10:08.365
Guess you really get what you pay for.

293
10:08.804 --> 10:09.524
Get up.

294
10:10.044 --> 10:11.164
Don't dirty my chair.

295
10:12.085 --> 10:12.804
We're brothers.

296
10:12.965 --> 10:14.485
Why split what's yours and mine?

297
10:15.164 --> 10:16.365
What's yours is mine.

298
10:16.404 --> 10:16.965
What's mine

299
10:17.725 --> 10:18.764
is still mine, of course.

300
10:19.605 --> 10:21.085
I said get up. Didn't you hear me?

301
10:23.804 --> 10:24.725
Sorry, Liren.

302
10:25.445 --> 10:26.485
From now on,

303
10:26.764 --> 10:27.684
the chairman's seat

304
10:27.684 --> 10:28.965
belongs to me, because

305
10:30.164 --> 10:31.125
you've been dismissed.

306
10:33.644 --> 10:34.205
Then again,

307
10:34.524 --> 10:35.804
I'm still used to

308
10:35.884 --> 10:36.644
that wooden chair

309
10:36.725 --> 10:38.125
in my office.

310
10:38.965 --> 10:40.005
Too much comfort

311
10:40.005 --> 10:40.644
breeds laziness.

312
10:40.845 --> 10:41.404
You forget

313
10:41.445 --> 10:42.644
where you came from

314
10:42.684 --> 10:43.725
and lose your roots.

315
10:45.644 --> 10:46.445
In broad daylight,

316
10:46.764 --> 10:48.005
you're already sleep-talking?

317
10:48.365 --> 10:49.524
I also wish it weren't true.

318
10:50.924 --> 10:51.764
Take a look at this.

319
10:56.965 --> 10:58.884
According to Jiali's corporate charter,

320
10:58.965 --> 11:00.485
(Notice: Removing Di Liren as Chairman) Chapter 7, Article 13,

321
11:00.485 --> 11:01.965
and Senior Management

322
11:01.965 --> 11:03.884
Performance Evaluation Measures

323
11:03.924 --> 11:05.085
during

324
11:06.404 --> 11:06.884
Di Liren's

325
11:06.884 --> 11:09.605
tenure as Chairman,

326
11:10.044 --> 11:12.564
the annual business segment revenue completion rate

327
11:12.804 --> 11:13.725
was only

328
11:14.884 --> 11:16.005
fifty-two percent,

329
11:17.005 --> 11:18.245
and for three quarters,

330
11:18.404 --> 11:19.404
he failed to meet

331
11:19.485 --> 11:21.725
the KPIs set by the Board.

332
11:22.005 --> 11:22.485
Therefore,

333
11:22.644 --> 11:24.605
the Board voted unanimously

334
11:25.085 --> 11:27.125
to remove Di Liren

335
11:27.884 --> 11:28.884
as Chairman.

336
11:29.764 --> 11:30.564
This resolution

337
11:31.404 --> 11:33.044
takes effect on the date

338
11:34.005 --> 11:34.644
(Jiali Cosmetics) of issuance.

339
11:36.804 --> 11:38.085
You spearheaded this, right?

340
11:38.845 --> 11:39.965
Yu Meng forced my hand.

341
11:41.085 --> 11:42.404
I had no choice.

342
11:42.684 --> 11:43.784
Just what you wanted, huh?

343
11:45.164 --> 11:45.884
I know what

344
11:45.965 --> 11:46.725
you're thinking.

345
11:47.284 --> 11:48.684
You've always wanted

346
11:49.325 --> 11:50.284
to take Jiali

347
11:50.284 --> 11:50.965
and my spot.

348
11:51.284 --> 11:52.284
You think helping Yu Meng

349
11:52.284 --> 11:53.164
drive me out

350
11:53.644 --> 11:54.884
will let you rest easy?

351
