699
25:27.364 --> 25:28.445
is even exactly the same.

700
25:29.284 --> 25:30.445
It's not a threat.

701
25:32.124 --> 25:33.725
It's your only way out.

702
25:34.844 --> 25:35.604
Impressive, Mr. Di.

703
25:36.725 --> 25:37.645
You've stepped up.

704
25:40.364 --> 25:41.485
I owe it all

705
25:42.965 --> 25:44.925
to your fine coaching, Han.

706
25:50.524 --> 25:52.124
Your dad truly is shrewd.

707
25:52.364 --> 25:53.226
With him backing you,

708
25:53.645 --> 25:54.844
you're playing without fear.

709
25:56.165 --> 25:57.405
The Weng family does work fast.

710
25:57.804 --> 25:58.725
And you're much tougher

711
25:58.725 --> 25:59.414
than I thought.

712
25:59.804 --> 26:00.925
But Han Guang won't confess.

713
26:01.485 --> 26:03.044
He even blames our family

714
26:03.124 --> 26:04.181
for looking down on him

715
26:04.284 --> 26:05.324
and guarding against him.

716
26:05.564 --> 26:06.764
My family trusted Di Liren.

717
26:07.124 --> 26:07.685
But look at

718
26:07.764 --> 26:08.604
what happened.

719
26:09.685 --> 26:10.645
Guarding and trusting

720
26:10.844 --> 26:11.604
are both wrong.

721
26:11.885 --> 26:13.116
What's the right thing to do?

722
26:13.485 --> 26:14.524
I don't think any approach

723
26:14.524 --> 26:15.364
is universally right.

724
26:15.725 --> 26:17.145
In relationships, it all comes down

725
26:17.445 --> 26:18.205
to conscience.

726
26:20.804 --> 26:22.165
Things went so smoothly this time

727
26:22.485 --> 26:23.445
thanks to both of you.

728
26:24.645 --> 26:25.165
When you can,

729
26:25.165 --> 26:26.405
you should thank Ms. Hui too.

730
26:26.685 --> 26:27.982
Much of the evidence and leads

731
26:28.165 --> 26:29.165
were gathered by her.

732
26:29.645 --> 26:30.764
I'll go thank her in person.

733
26:32.245 --> 26:33.485
But from here on,

734
26:33.645 --> 26:35.364
I won't be much help.

735
26:36.044 --> 26:36.804
Don't worry.

736
26:37.645 --> 26:38.725
With Mr. Jiao on your side,

737
26:38.925 --> 26:40.165
given enough time,

738
26:40.324 --> 26:41.804
he'll definitely put Han Guang

739
26:41.885 --> 26:42.485
behind bars.

740
26:42.885 --> 26:43.645
You're right.

741
26:44.485 --> 26:45.044
From now on,

742
26:45.965 --> 26:46.925
it's my show.

743
26:48.844 --> 26:49.245
Lin,

744
26:49.564 --> 26:50.925
transfer these to the court

745
26:50.965 --> 26:51.524
quickly.

746
26:52.844 --> 26:54.725
(Lucky Beauty Yu) Hello, my lovely followers!

747
26:54.725 --> 26:55.685
Have you noticed

748
26:55.685 --> 26:56.645
lately

749
26:56.645 --> 26:58.005
that my account's style

750
26:58.124 --> 26:59.725
has changed a little bit?

751
26:59.725 --> 27:00.645
I've been posting

752
27:00.804 --> 27:01.925
deep life reflections.

753
27:01.965 --> 27:03.124
Some of you even

754
27:03.124 --> 27:03.965
DM'd me,

755
27:04.044 --> 27:05.165
asking if I pivoted

756
27:05.324 --> 27:06.445
into a life-advice guru.

757
27:06.645 --> 27:07.084
You guys,

758
27:07.084 --> 27:08.245
how are you so sharp?

759
27:09.564 --> 27:10.564
Sorry.

760
27:11.485 --> 27:12.965
I'm terrible in the kitchen,

761
27:13.284 --> 27:13.844
so no

762
27:13.925 --> 27:15.005
chicken soup for the soul.

763
27:16.124 --> 27:17.604
Speaking of pivoting,

764
27:17.725 --> 27:18.965
I do have plenty of ideas.

765
27:19.165 --> 27:19.925
But right now,

766
27:20.084 --> 27:21.044
the one thing

767
27:21.044 --> 27:22.124
I want to do most is this:

768
27:24.604 --> 27:25.725
Buy a drink,

769
27:25.844 --> 27:29.005
get a one-hour legal consultation.

770
27:29.685 --> 27:30.324
Meet my team.

771
27:30.925 --> 27:31.245
Come on.

772
27:32.445 --> 27:35.084
(Letter of Appointment) This is our senior attorney,

773
27:35.205 --> 27:35.685
Jiao Xu.

774
27:36.364 --> 27:37.245
For anyone in need,

775
27:37.324 --> 27:38.005
dear followers,

776
27:38.165 --> 27:39.445
he will provide legal aid.

777
27:40.324 --> 27:41.965
And this is my best friend

778
27:42.165 --> 27:43.445
and partner, Liu Zi.

779
27:44.084 --> 27:44.725
Our doors here

780
27:44.844 --> 27:46.084
will always be open

781
27:46.245 --> 27:47.205
to all of you.

782
27:47.485 --> 27:48.764
If you have any life troubles

783
27:48.925 --> 27:50.245
or relationship issues,

784
27:50.405 --> 27:51.445
come to us anytime.

785
27:51.685 --> 27:53.245
We'll help you

786
27:53.405 --> 27:54.485
turn every single tear

787
27:54.604 --> 27:56.604
into ammunition against fate.

788
27:56.645 --> 27:57.364
That's right.

789
27:57.485 --> 27:58.405
Lovely followers,

790
27:58.604 --> 27:59.124
in one week,

791
27:59.165 --> 28:00.445
we'll be hosting

792
28:00.685 --> 28:02.364
a tasting event for our new drinks.

793
28:02.564 --> 28:03.245
You're welcome

794
28:03.245 --> 28:04.764
to come, drink, and have fun.

795
28:05.645 --> 28:06.524
See you!

796
28:06.844 --> 28:07.764
- See you there! - Bye!

797
28:07.965 --> 28:09.044
Bye!

798
28:10.645 --> 28:11.324
Okay.

799
28:11.725 --> 28:12.044
Okay.

800
28:12.084 --> 28:12.844
Stream ended.

801
28:15.524 --> 28:16.524
Are you settling down

802
28:16.604 --> 28:17.485
to run this shop?

803
28:19.844 --> 28:21.044
That question of yours

804
28:21.564 --> 28:22.925
is like asking a seagull

805
28:23.084 --> 28:24.245
if it plans to stay

806
28:24.245 --> 28:25.685
on one rock forever.

807
28:26.405 --> 28:28.564
I'm currently a senior influencer,

808
28:28.844 --> 28:29.965
club partner,

809
28:30.124 --> 28:32.324
and former Jiali brand ambassador.

810
28:33.445 --> 28:35.364
Being a slashie is all the rage now.

811
28:35.524 --> 28:36.485
I'm definitely adding

812
28:36.645 --> 28:37.804
more slashes to my title.

813
28:38.604 --> 28:39.165
For example,

814
28:39.524 --> 28:40.965
head of the Haomeng line?

815
28:41.364 --> 28:42.124
Or

816
28:42.524 --> 28:44.324
founder of the Beat the Scumbags series.

817
28:48.205 --> 28:50.005
Beat the Scumbags. I should write that down.

818
29:05.685 --> 29:06.245
Who is it?

819
29:06.604 --> 29:07.564
Police! Open up!

820
29:15.324 --> 29:15.925
Coming.

821
29:38.405 --> 29:39.005
We're late.

822
29:39.405 --> 29:40.405
Mr. Han has been detained

823
29:40.405 --> 29:41.052
by the police.

824
29:41.364 --> 29:42.885
He can no longer trade Jiali's shares.

825
30:12.844 --> 30:13.645
Five years.

826
30:16.084 --> 30:17.564
Han Guang has finally been arrested.

827
30:20.245 --> 30:21.725
Evil gets what it deserves.

828
30:29.205 --> 30:30.214
With Han Guang locked up

829
30:30.485 --> 30:31.524
and Xin back home,

830
30:31.885 --> 30:33.205
today is a great day.

831
30:33.364 --> 30:34.245
Cheers!

832
30:34.524 --> 30:36.364
- Cheers! - Cheers!

833
30:36.524 --> 30:37.645
Thank you all for coming.

834
30:41.564 --> 30:43.324
Xin and I both thank you

835
30:43.804 --> 30:44.725
for helping us

836
30:44.965 --> 30:46.005
and for coming today.

837
30:48.524 --> 30:49.259
Don't mention it.

838
30:49.685 --> 30:50.205
Thank you.

839
31:03.205 --> 31:03.645
Ms. Weng,

840
31:04.445 --> 31:05.124
here you are.

841
31:15.364 --> 31:16.084
This is mine.

842
31:18.804 --> 31:20.124
I hung it on my bag.

843
31:21.925 --> 31:22.485
Jiao Xu,

844
31:23.405 --> 31:24.124
thank you.

845
31:26.725 --> 31:27.445
You remember me?

846
31:28.165 --> 31:30.364
Are you still at Yihe Firm?

847
31:31.324 --> 31:31.685
Yes.

848
31:32.485 --> 31:32.925
Ms. Weng,

849
31:33.485 --> 31:34.245
I'd like to report

850
31:34.804 --> 31:36.044
that I'm already a partner now.

851
31:36.685 --> 31:37.485
You did it.

852
31:40.124 --> 31:40.804
You've become

853
31:40.844 --> 31:42.044
an outstanding attorney.

854
31:46.084 --> 31:47.084
Not outstanding at all.

855
31:47.645 --> 31:48.284
Back then,

856
31:48.685 --> 31:49.804
I couldn't help you.

857
31:51.844 --> 31:52.445
I'm sorry.

858
31:55.885 --> 31:57.165
That wasn't your fault at all.

859
31:59.005 --> 31:59.725
Don't worry.

860
32:00.165 --> 32:01.604
Xin is doing better and better.

861
32:02.405 --> 32:03.284
Daily communication

862
32:03.364 --> 32:04.124
is no problem.

863
32:06.804 --> 32:07.524
Do you guys

864
32:07.685 --> 32:08.925
get many consultations?

865
32:10.658 --> 32:11.844
(Buy a Drink, Get 1 Hour of Legal Consultation)

866
32:11.844 --> 32:12.524
Quite a lot.

867
32:12.804 --> 32:14.005
Sometimes we're swamped.

868
32:15.324 --> 32:16.284
Can I join?

869
32:17.764 --> 32:19.084
Ms. Weng, you...

870
32:20.524 --> 32:21.445
You all helped me.

871
32:22.364 --> 32:23.485
So I want to help others

872
32:24.205 --> 32:25.205
to pass on that strength.

873
32:30.685 --> 32:31.524
I can do it.

874
32:31.804 --> 32:32.405
Don't forget.

875
32:32.524 --> 32:33.685
I held the record

876
32:33.804 --> 32:35.245
for the highest score in our major.

877
32:37.445 --> 32:39.044
Even though I've been sick for years

878
32:40.124 --> 32:42.165
and might be a bit rusty,

879
32:42.844 --> 32:43.564
I believe

880
32:43.965 --> 32:45.084
with a little preparation,

881
32:45.445 --> 32:46.925
I'll pick it up in no time.

882
32:47.524 --> 32:48.965
I believe in your skills completely.

883
32:49.925 --> 32:51.445
But you just recovered. Why not

884
32:51.844 --> 32:52.564
rest a bit longer?

885
32:53.411 --> 32:55.052
♪Locked inside a pendulum♪

886
32:55.052 --> 32:56.757
♪Repeating the same fate♪

887
32:56.757 --> 32:58.185
♪I hear high heels♪

888
32:58.185 --> 32:59.954
♪Crushing silent replies♪

889
33:00.165 --> 33:01.925
I've wasted too many years already.

890
33:03.725 --> 33:04.645
Even if

891
33:05.604 --> 33:07.124
I haven't grown

892
33:07.124 --> 33:08.245
into a blooming rose yet,

893
33:09.205 --> 33:09.804
at least

894
33:10.184 --> 33:11.865
I'm already an awakened flower.

895
33:11.953 --> 33:13.594
♪Into gray diamond gems♪

896
33:13.844 --> 33:14.885
Just give me a chance

897
33:14.965 --> 33:16.205
to fully awaken.

898
33:20.627 --> 33:22.332
♪I am nobody's accessory♪

899
33:22.764 --> 33:23.965
You're the legal counsel.

900
33:24.324 --> 33:24.925
You decide.

901
33:25.337 --> 33:26.765
♪I can still pierce the sky♪

902
33:26.765 --> 33:28.428
♪When all the lights go out♪

903
33:28.925 --> 33:29.445
Ms. Weng,

904
33:30.604 --> 33:32.084
back then, you told me firmly,

905
33:32.764 --> 33:34.245
"Jiao Xu, I believe in you."

906
33:34.925 --> 33:35.925
Now I'm telling you too,

907
33:36.885 --> 33:37.284
Ms. Weng,

908
33:38.005 --> 33:38.630
I believe in you.

909
33:38.630 --> 33:41.389
♪Wings torn apart by the night♪

910
33:41.885 --> 33:42.685
Then

911
33:43.165 --> 33:44.364
let's form

912
33:45.084 --> 33:47.685
the ultimate Dream Team of Wu Ta.

913
33:49.324 --> 33:50.324
Dream Team.

914
33:50.324 --> 33:51.084
Love the name.

915
33:51.645 --> 33:52.284
Awesome!

916
33:52.764 --> 33:53.725
Dream Team.

917
33:54.564 --> 33:55.324
Let's eat.

918
34:00.604 --> 34:01.205
Zi,

919
34:01.604 --> 34:02.485
I want some beef.

920
34:02.804 --> 34:03.964
I'll get you another plate.

921
34:06.486 --> 34:07.205
It's rare for us

922
34:07.205 --> 34:08.244
to sit together like this.

923
34:09.044 --> 34:09.524
Cheers?

924
34:10.724 --> 34:11.124
Cheers!

925
34:17.845 --> 34:19.119
You can really drink, Ms. Hui.

926
34:19.325 --> 34:20.134
Let's do this often.

927
34:22.885 --> 34:23.724
I'm afraid we can't.

928
34:25.524 --> 34:26.564
If all goes as planned,

929
34:27.044 --> 34:27.724
this will be

930
34:27.765 --> 34:28.724
our last meeting.

931
34:32.765 --> 34:33.765
You're going abroad?

932
34:35.244 --> 34:36.684
The trust issue is resolved,

933
34:37.365 --> 34:38.524
and Han Guang has fallen.

934
34:39.724 --> 34:40.925
I can finally take Haoyu

935
34:41.285 --> 34:41.885
with me.

936
34:45.084 --> 34:45.724
Best of luck.

937
34:47.285 --> 34:48.084
And I hope you

938
34:48.805 --> 34:49.885
get to enjoy your beef too.

939
34:50.485 --> 34:51.365
It's been in there too long.

940
34:51.365 --> 34:52.445
- I completely forgot. - It's overcooked.

941
34:52.485 --> 34:53.325
I forgot. My beef.

942
34:53.325 --> 34:53.965
(This period)

943
34:54.365 --> 34:56.164
(where life's mask was stripped away)

944
34:56.244 --> 34:56.965
(taught me)

945
34:57.765 --> 34:58.765
(that a good life)

946
34:59.244 --> 35:00.325
(is never given by anyone,)

947
35:00.885 --> 35:02.084
(nor should it be.)

948
35:02.805 --> 35:03.564
(True fortune)

949
35:03.965 --> 35:05.005
(comes from taking action)

950
35:05.365 --> 35:06.885
(and holding fate in your own hands.)

951
35:21.365 --> 35:22.204
Why are you here?

952
35:23.084 --> 35:24.204
Picking up my son.

953
35:25.445 --> 35:26.044
You drag him

954
35:26.084 --> 35:27.124
from place to place.

955
35:27.485 --> 35:28.662
What kind of life is that?

956
35:31.325 --> 35:32.325
Haoyu won't go with you.

957
35:33.965 --> 35:34.564
Don't come back

958
35:34.644 --> 35:35.564
and disturb our peace.

959
35:41.805 --> 35:42.445
Let go of me.

960
35:43.885 --> 35:44.604
Have you forgotten

961
35:44.805 --> 35:45.965
about the trust?

962
35:47.204 --> 35:48.485
I gave the trust to Yu Meng.

963
35:49.164 --> 35:50.465
We agreed to settle peacefully.

964
35:51.084 --> 35:51.564
This matter

965
35:52.005 --> 35:52.724
ends here.

966
35:53.524 --> 35:55.044
You won't get a single cent back.

967
35:55.244 --> 35:56.285
Are you crazy?

968
35:57.861 --> 35:58.805
Did you lose your mind

969
35:58.965 --> 36:00.084
to do something so stupid?

970
36:00.965 --> 36:02.244
Do you think this is charity?

971
36:02.604 --> 36:03.925
I don't want to drag this on.

972
36:05.325 --> 36:06.564
I think it's the best outcome

973
36:06.885 --> 36:07.765
for both of us.

974
36:08.124 --> 36:09.005
Then what about me?

975
36:11.405 --> 36:12.564
Back then, to save our son,

976
36:13.325 --> 36:15.014
I gave up my pride as a live-in son-in-law,

977
36:15.084 --> 36:16.244
waiting on that whole family.

978
36:16.684 --> 36:18.084
I've groveled for all these years,

979
36:18.564 --> 36:19.485
being like a dog

980
36:19.485 --> 36:20.564
ordered around by them.

981
36:20.724 --> 36:21.445
And in the end,

982
36:22.204 --> 36:23.436
I got nothing on either side.

983
36:23.684 --> 36:24.564
Now my ex-wife

984
36:24.564 --> 36:25.402
and my current wife

985
36:25.604 --> 36:26.445
are in cahoots,

986
36:26.445 --> 36:27.365
teaming up against me.

987
36:28.765 --> 36:30.084
Are you playing me for a fool?

988
36:30.805 --> 36:32.285
Don't make yourself sound so noble.

989
36:33.765 --> 36:34.885
Ask yourself:

990
36:35.845 --> 36:37.084
How many times did I beg you

991
36:37.365 --> 36:38.084
to stop?

992
36:39.044 --> 36:40.204
You've been too greedy,

993
36:40.445 --> 36:41.845
lying to me again and again,

994
36:42.005 --> 36:43.325
dug your own grave step by step.

995
36:43.965 --> 36:44.608
Who's to blame?

996
36:45.365 --> 36:46.489
You threw the chances away

997
36:46.524 --> 36:47.564
with your own hands.

998
36:48.485 --> 36:49.005
Fine.

999
36:50.485 --> 36:51.325
Blame it all on me.

1000
36:53.005 --> 36:54.524
Burning bridges like this

1001
36:55.325 --> 36:56.524
and playing it so well.

1002
36:56.845 --> 36:58.325
I lost my chairman seat

1003
36:58.765 --> 36:59.765
and lost the trust.

1004
37:00.204 --> 37:01.204
Han Guang fell,

1005
37:01.684 --> 37:02.965
and the Weng family gave

1006
37:03.325 --> 37:04.885
his Jiali shares back to Yu Meng

1007
37:05.124 --> 37:06.084
as a favor.

1008
37:06.524 --> 37:07.204
Now Jiali

1009
37:07.285 --> 37:08.485
has nothing to do with me.

1010
37:08.485 --> 37:09.604
I have nothing left.

1011
37:13.925 --> 37:14.965
It's all your fault.

1012
37:17.005 --> 37:17.805
You were the one

1013
37:17.925 --> 37:19.124
who pushed me to Yu Meng.

1014
37:25.524 --> 37:26.164
Blame me.

1015
37:27.445 --> 37:27.965
Fault me.

1016
37:29.925 --> 37:30.765
Whatever.

1017
37:31.485 --> 37:33.244
Because I gave up on you long ago.

1018
37:33.805 --> 37:34.644
Since we despise

1019
37:34.644 --> 37:36.005
each other so much,

1020
37:37.885 --> 37:39.285
why stay tied together?

1021
37:42.965 --> 37:44.124
Here are your documents.

1022
37:44.684 --> 37:45.794
I've meant to return them.

1023
37:46.104 --> 37:47.485
Your clothes, shoes, and larger items

1024
37:47.485 --> 37:48.562
have been shipped to you.

1025
37:52.445 --> 37:54.044
Are you really going to be this cold?

1026
37:57.325 --> 37:57.925
I'm exhausted.

1027
38:00.325 --> 38:01.724
I'm done dealing with you.

1028
38:02.604 --> 38:03.445
I want nothing

1029
38:03.524 --> 38:05.005
of you around me.

1030
38:06.485 --> 38:07.005
You and I

1031
38:09.485 --> 38:10.204
go separate ways.

1032
38:12.604 --> 38:13.357
What about Haoyu?

1033
38:13.965 --> 38:14.757
What does he think?

1034
38:16.485 --> 38:17.684
I'll explain it to him.

1035
38:18.204 --> 38:19.485
If you still care about him,

1036
38:20.044 --> 38:21.005
stop causing him

1037
38:21.044 --> 38:21.765
any more distress.

1038
38:30.084 --> 38:30.805
(Come home, son.)

1039
38:31.675 --> 38:33.161
(I'll do as you say about the trust)

1040
38:33.724 --> 38:34.365
(and let it go.)

1041
38:35.124 --> 38:35.961
(I want to see you.)

1042
38:37.204 --> 38:37.564
Mom.

1043
38:39.644 --> 38:40.005
Hurry.

1044
38:40.405 --> 38:40.885
Try this.

1045
38:41.636 --> 38:42.684
I waited two hours in line

1046
38:42.684 --> 38:43.044
for this.

1047
38:43.285 --> 38:44.684
Young girls are all into this now.

1048
38:45.285 --> 38:46.805
I'm old. I'm no young girl.

1049
38:47.684 --> 38:48.325
Says who?

1050
38:49.724 --> 38:50.925
When we go out together,

1051
38:51.084 --> 38:52.131
they think we're siblings.

1052
38:52.485 --> 38:53.644
How are you not a young girl?

1053
38:53.644 --> 38:54.124
All right.

1054
38:54.845 --> 38:55.805
Stop teasing me.

1055
38:57.164 --> 38:57.524
Mom,

1056
38:58.925 --> 38:59.485
I'm sorry.

1057
39:00.044 --> 39:00.684
I shouldn't

1058
39:01.164 --> 39:01.965
have fought you.

1059
39:02.965 --> 39:03.823
It's not your fault.

1060
39:04.244 --> 39:05.604
I was too emotional that day.

1061
39:07.044 --> 39:07.885
About the trust,

1062
39:09.044 --> 39:10.204
I respect your decision.

1063
39:11.124 --> 39:11.564
Really?

1064
39:12.445 --> 39:12.805
Then

1065
39:13.845 --> 39:14.604
did Dad agree too?

1066
39:17.005 --> 39:17.965
It's basically settled.

1067
39:20.204 --> 39:21.044
As for your dad,

1068
39:22.524 --> 39:23.485
I plan to leave him

1069
39:24.564 --> 39:25.365
and cut all contact.

1070
39:30.765 --> 39:32.044
Is it because of the trust?

1071
39:34.684 --> 39:36.124
Our personalities clash.

1072
39:37.084 --> 39:37.644
Together,

1073
39:37.684 --> 39:38.604
we irritate each other.

1074
39:38.965 --> 39:39.845
Better to split.

1075
39:40.445 --> 39:41.325
Can you accept that?

1076
39:42.405 --> 39:43.244
I'm an adult.

1077
39:44.044 --> 39:45.005
I don't have to choose

1078
39:45.451 --> 39:45.925
between Dad

1079
39:45.925 --> 39:46.925
and Mom.

1080
39:48.005 --> 39:49.005
Of course I can.

1081
39:50.044 --> 39:51.244
I respect what you two decide.

1082
39:51.885 --> 39:52.285
But

1083
39:53.564 --> 39:54.524
I can still live

1084
39:54.524 --> 39:55.204
with you, right?

1085
39:55.805 --> 39:56.724
You're my son.

1086
39:57.684 --> 39:59.204
Who else would you live with?

1087
40:01.124 --> 40:02.244
And about the trust,

1088
40:03.485 --> 40:04.405
don't blame your dad

1089
40:04.684 --> 40:05.684
or hold it against him.

1090
40:08.044 --> 40:08.925
He loves you very much

1091
40:09.925 --> 40:11.445
and is a wonderful father.

1092
40:12.555 --> 40:13.244
Don't cut him off

1093
40:13.244 --> 40:14.325
just because I stopped

1094
40:15.084 --> 40:15.925
seeing him.

1095
40:16.845 --> 40:18.604
I just don't know how to face him

1096
40:19.765 --> 40:20.845
for now.

1097
40:22.164 --> 40:23.805
I need some time.

1098
40:26.445 --> 40:26.845
Mom,

1099
40:27.644 --> 40:28.325
drink it before

1100
40:28.564 --> 40:29.206
it gets cold.

1101
40:30.990 --> 40:31.928
(Passport)

1102
40:33.485 --> 40:34.124
I've decided

1103
40:34.885 --> 40:35.885
to go abroad with you.

1104
40:38.204 --> 40:39.084
That's great.

1105
40:39.965 --> 40:40.765
Why suddenly

1106
40:41.285 --> 40:42.044
so obedient

1107
40:42.044 --> 40:42.925
and willing to come?

1108
40:44.285 --> 40:45.885
Well, you are my mom.

1109
40:46.005 --> 40:46.840
Of course, I listen

1110
40:47.204 --> 40:47.684
to you.

1111
40:52.601 --> 40:54.903
=The Vanishing Beauty= (Next Episode Preview)

1112
40:55.405 --> 40:56.204
I'm looking

1113
40:56.204 --> 40:57.485
for Di Liren, the chairman

1114
40:57.485 --> 40:58.164
of Jiali Cosmetics.

1115
40:58.164 --> 40:59.325
Let me up right now.

1116
40:59.325 --> 40:59.845
Sir,

1117
40:59.845 --> 41:00.965
it's building policy.

1118
41:01.084 --> 41:02.485
You'll need an employee badge

1119
41:02.485 --> 41:03.564
or an invitation code to go up.

1120
41:03.564 --> 41:04.044
Hello.

1121
41:04.325 --> 41:05.765
We're from Wuyou Moving Company.

1122
41:06.445 --> 41:07.244
Let me see Haoyu.

1123
41:08.285 --> 41:08.965
Are you worthy?

1124
41:09.524 --> 41:10.365
I'm his father.

1125
41:10.485 --> 41:11.885
If I weren't out of cash,

1126
41:12.485 --> 41:13.365
I wouldn't be

1127
41:13.365 --> 41:14.457
disturbing you, Mr. Busy.

1128
41:15.124 --> 41:15.644
But I don't

1129
41:15.644 --> 41:16.786
want to give you money now.

1130
41:17.124 --> 41:18.564
I won't support a gambling addict.

1131
41:19.204 --> 41:19.845
All right.

1132
41:20.445 --> 41:21.845
Then I'll go talk to Lu Hui.

1133
41:22.684 --> 41:23.524
We can talk

1134
41:23.564 --> 41:25.244
about how her father, Lu Zhiming, died.

1135
41:40.618 --> 41:45.487
♪Old dreams have faded in color♪

1136
41:47.971 --> 41:52.834
♪A lonely heart torn in conflict♪

1137
41:55.292 --> 42:00.137
♪The love that stumbled along♪

1138
42:00.582 --> 42:07.084
♪Was just a quiet release♪

1139
42:09.816 --> 42:16.769
♪I write the future into a song, honoring the brave with no regrets♪

1140
42:17.319 --> 42:23.249
♪Turning all losses into the passion of this moment♪

1141
42:24.373 --> 42:31.604
♪I write the future into a song, for the me who never walks away♪

1142
42:31.907 --> 42:37.080
♪Forging all weaknesses into sharp, bold colors♪

1143
42:37.700 --> 42:49.168
♪In this life, I follow only my own choice♪

1144
42:51.668 --> 42:56.916
♪The chilled night has lost its color♪

1145
42:58.957 --> 43:04.392
♪No need to echo those who drifted apart♪

1146
43:06.214 --> 43:11.611
♪No longer proving my worth to anyone♪

1147
43:11.611 --> 43:20.256
♪The answer has long been etched in my silhouette♪

1148
43:20.732 --> 43:28.295
♪I write the future into a song, for the me who never walks away♪

1149
43:28.295 --> 43:34.141
♪Paving every twist and turn into a path forward♪

1150
43:34.141 --> 43:44.308
♪The ending of this life will be set by me♪
